# ORCA 6.1 - epoxide_4_methyl_1_2_epoxybutane - Recommended for manuscript
! B3LYP def2-TZVP Opt Freq D3BJ RIJCOSX
%pal nprocs 16 end
%method
  Functional B3LYP
  Basis def2-TZVP
  Dispersion D3BJ
end
%output
  Print[ P_Mulliken ] 1
  Print[ P_Atombasis ] 1
end
* xyzfile 0 1 ..\xyz_files\epoxide_4_methyl_1_2_epoxybutane.xyz
